https://datalemur.com/questions/completed-trades

Sol1: 
SELECT 
  u.city,
  COUNT(t.order_id) AS total_orders
FROM
  users u
JOIN
  trades t
ON 
  u.user_id = t.user_id
WHERE
  t.status = 'Completed'
GROUP BY
  u.city
ORDER BY total_orders  DESC
LIMIT 3

